{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"LOAD \u0022Graphics/berg.png\u0022\n\n\nSCREEN ALPHA 0, 0          ; B\u00F6rja med svart sk\u00E4rm\nSCREEN FADE 0, 255, 120    ; Fade in hela lagret p\u00E5 2 sek\n\nSPRITE LOAD 1, \u0022Graphics/hero.png\u0022\nSPRITE POS 1, 160, 120\nSPRITE ON 1\n\nMainLoop:\n    IF LAYERFADING(0) = 0 THEN\n        ; Sk\u00E4rmen \u00E4r fullt synlig, starta spelet\n        IF KEYSTATE(\u0022SPACE\u0022) = 1 THEN\n            SCREEN FADE 0, 0, 60   ; Fade ut allt p\u00E5 1 sek\n            SPRITE FADE 1, 0, 60\n        ENDIF\n    ENDIF\n    WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}